{"seq":4,"slug":"conflict-resolution","title":"冲突解决","stage":"DONE","category":"negotiation-communication","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.16,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"冲突解决-从对抗到协作的转化之道\">冲突解决：从对抗到协作的转化之道</h1><p>冲突是人类社会不可避免的现象。无论是个人关系中的意见分歧、团队内部的资源争夺，还是组织层面的战略路线之争，冲突无处不在。然而，冲突本身并非全然消极——关键在于我们如何理解冲突、回应冲突、转化冲突。有效的冲突解决不是简单地消除分歧，而是通过系统性的方法将破坏性的对抗转化为建设性的对话，最终实现各方利益的动态平衡。</p>\n<p>本 Hub 从四个维度系统梳理冲突解决的理论与实践。<strong>冲突理论</strong>章节建立认知框架，帮助你理解冲突的本质动力、典型模式和升降级规律；<strong>调解</strong>章节聚焦第三方介入的专业方法，涵盖从通用流程到职场场景的调解技术；<strong>组织冲突</strong>章节面向管理者，探讨团队、跨部门、领导力层面的冲突管理策略；<strong>恢复性实践</strong>章节则超越传统的「赢输」思维，介绍以修复关系和重建信任为核心的现代冲突处理范式。</p>\n<p>学习冲突解决不仅是掌握一组技巧，更是培养一种看待差异的心智模式。当你能够将冲突视为改善关系和推动变革的契机，而非必须回避或压制的威胁，你的谈判能力和领导效能将获得质的飞跃。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conflict-theory","title":"冲突理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/conflict-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conflict-dynamics","title":"冲突动力学 Conflict Dynamics","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/conflict-theory/conflict-dynamics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"thomas-kilmann-model","title":"Thomas-Kilmann 冲突模式 Thomas-Kilmann Conflict Mode Instrument","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/conflict-theory/thomas-kilmann-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"escalation-deescalation","title":"冲突升级与降级 Escalation and De-escalation","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/conflict-theory/escalation-deescalation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"mediation","title":"调解","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/mediation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mediation-process","title":"调解流程与原则 Mediation Process and Principles","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/mediation/mediation-process"},{"seq":2,"slug":"facilitative-mediation","title":"促进式调解 Facilitative Mediation","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/mediation/facilitative-mediation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"workplace-mediation","title":"职场冲突调解 Workplace Mediation","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/mediation/workplace-mediation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"organizational-conflict","title":"组织冲突","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/organizational-conflict","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"team-conflict","title":"团队冲突管理 Team Conflict Management","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/organizational-conflict/team-conflict"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-department","title":"跨部门冲突 Cross-departmental Conflict","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/organizational-conflict/cross-department"},{"seq":3,"slug":"leadership-conflict","title":"领导力与冲突 Leadership and Conflict","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/organizational-conflict/leadership-conflict"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"restorative-practices","title":"恢复性实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/restorative-practices","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"restorative-justice","title":"恢复性正义 Restorative Justice","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/restorative-practices/restorative-justice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dialogue-circles","title":"对话圈与和平圈 Dialogue Circles and Peacemaking Circles","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/restorative-practices/dialogue-circles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"post-conflict-reconstruction","title":"冲突后重建 Post-conflict Reconstruction","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/conflict-resolution/restorative-practices/post-conflict-reconstruction"}]}]}